KED"], "size": 11.5, "bold": true, "color": "0E2A47", "align": "left", "leading": 13.799999999999999, "w": 120.26904296875}, {"t": "rect", "x": 32, "y": 508, "w": 600, "h": 82, "fill": "F5F7FA", "stroke": "D5DCE5", "lw": 1, "r": 8, "dash": false}, {"t": "text", "x": 48, "y": 568, "lines": ["Open sign-language models"], "size": 12, "bold": true, "color": "0E2A47", "align": "left", "leading": 14.399999999999999, "w": 164.6875}, {"t": "text", "x": 48, "y": 550, "lines": ["recognize isolated signs from their own vocabulary, or fingerspelling (Kaggle competitions); none translated hotel", "conversations reliably when we started"], "size": 10.5, "bold": false, "color": "1B2433", "align": "left", "leading": 13.5, "w": 568}, {"t": "rect", "x": 32, "y": 410, "w": 600, "h": 82, "fill": "F5F7FA", "stroke": "D5DCE5", "lw": 1, "r": 8, "dash": false}, {"t": "text", "x": 48, "y": 470, "lines": ["Google ASL dataset (Kaggle GISLR, 250 signs)"], "size": 12, "bold": true, "color": "0E2A47", "align": "left", "leading": 14.399999999999999, "w": 270.71875}, {"t": "text", "x": 48, "y": 452, "lines": ["covers only 7 of our 21 signs: yes, no, please, thank you, where, time, room. Missing: reservation, elevator, towel,", "breakfast, checkout, password..."], "size": 10.5, "bold": false, "color": "1B2433", "align": "left", "leading": 13.5, "w": 568}, {"t": "rect", "x": 32, "y": 334, "w": 600, "h": 60, "fill": "F5F7FA", "stroke": "D5DCE5", "lw": 1, "r": 8, "dash": false}, {"t": "text", "x": 48, "y": 372, "lines": ["ASL Citizen"], "size": 12, "bold": true, "color": "0E2A47", "align": "left", "leading": 14.399999999999999, "w": 70.66796875}, {"t": "text", "x": 48, "y": 354, "lines": ["license forbids redistribution; non-commercial research use only"], "size": 10.5, "bold": false, "color": "1B2433", "align": "left", "leading": 13.5, "w": 568}, {"t": "rect", "x": 32, "y": 258, "w": 600, "h": 60, "fill": "F5F7FA", "stroke": "D5DCE5", "lw": 1, "r": 8, "dash": false}, {"t": "text", "x": 48, "y": 296, 